    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Ultimate Party Game is a throwback to the classic party game formula. Use unique items and play original minigames in your quest to collect the most treasure, navigate wacky obstacles, and outplay your friends. You can play with 1-4 players in both local and online play, or with bots!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Silly Game Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of obstacles block your path to victory! Avoid them or use them to sabotage your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/d5194d404ea34c51ca8c66a3c98fd7aa.poster.avif?t=1751756590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/d5194d404ea34c51ca8c66a3c98fd7aa.webm?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/d5194d404ea34c51ca8c66a3c98fd7aa.mp4?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action-Packed Minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play minigames between rounds of the main game, or play the dedicated minigame mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8eae2ad7f847b5c43793f3cff6428be4.poster.avif?t=1751756590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8eae2ad7f847b5c43793f3cff6428be4.webm?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8eae2ad7f847b5c43793f3cff6428be4.mp4?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whimsical Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a collection of unique Items to inch you closer to your goal (or prevent your friends from reaching theirs!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8ab507eb5255533a17e598040d391c7d.poster.avif?t=1751756590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8ab507eb5255533a17e598040d391c7d.webm?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8ab507eb5255533a17e598040d391c7d.mp4?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Ultimate Party Game is a throwback to the classic party game formula. Use unique items and play original minigames in your quest to collect the most treasure, navigate wacky obstacles, and outplay your friends. You can play with 1-4 players in both local and online play, or with bots!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Silly Game Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of obstacles block your path to victory! Avoid them or use them to sabotage your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/d5194d404ea34c51ca8c66a3c98fd7aa.poster.avif?t=1751756590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/d5194d404ea34c51ca8c66a3c98fd7aa.webm?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/d5194d404ea34c51ca8c66a3c98fd7aa.mp4?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action-Packed Minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play minigames between rounds of the main game, or play the dedicated minigame mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8eae2ad7f847b5c43793f3cff6428be4.poster.avif?t=1751756590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8eae2ad7f847b5c43793f3cff6428be4.webm?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8eae2ad7f847b5c43793f3cff6428be4.mp4?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whimsical Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a collection of unique Items to inch you closer to your goal (or prevent your friends from reaching theirs!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8ab507eb5255533a17e598040d391c7d.poster.avif?t=1751756590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8ab507eb5255533a17e598040d391c7d.webm?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290950/extras/8ab507eb5255533a17e598040d391c7d.mp4?t=1751756590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
